  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: "\xC7\xF6l\xFCn sonunda a\u015F\u0131r\u0131 tan\u0131d\u0131k bir y\xFCz vard\u0131."
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: Kendisi.
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d599435c125d9fb89be9cbac5fed7f24, type: 2}
    text: "\xDClgen Han seni hi\xE7 sevmedi. Ben biliyorum... \xE7\xFCnk\xFC ben senim."
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    text: "Bu sahte kopya kendini \xE7o\u011Faltabiliyor, B\xF6r\xFChan'\u0131n korkular\u0131na b\xFCr\xFCn\xFCp onu yava\u015Flatabiliyor ve vuru\u015Flar\u0131n\u0131 daha g\xFC\xE7l\xFC yans\u0131tabiliyordu."
    duration: 0
    setFlag: 
